  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRYAD - Financing sustainable community forestry enterprises in Cameroon through support to ICRAF (International Centre for Research in Agroforestry)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity DRYAD - Financing sustainable community forestry enterprises in Cameroon through support to ICRAF (International Centre for Research in Agroforestry) is a component of CONGO - Improving Livelihoods and Land Use in Congo Basin Forests reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;4,335,353. It works in the following sector(s): Forestry development, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Forestry research.</narrative>
  </description>
